# Pinned CodeRabbit CLI distribution.
#
# The vendor publishes no checksum file, no signature, and no container image
# for the CLI (verified 2026-08-19: every one of
# releases/<version>/{coderabbit-<os>-<arch>.zip.sha256,.sig},
# releases/<version>/checksums.txt and releases/<version>/SHA256SUMS returns
# 404, and no image exists on ghcr.io or Docker Hub). The versioned download
# path is immutable by convention only.
#
# So the digests below are trust-on-first-use: they were captured once, by
# hand, from https://cli.coderabbit.ai/releases/${CODERABBIT_CLI_VERSION}/ and
# they are the integrity contract this repository enforces from then on. CI
# refuses to run a binary that does not match.
#
# The pin also freezes reviewed behavior, not only reviewed bytes. ADR-0090
# depends on one property of this exact build: `--config <files...>` REPLACES
# the built-in discovery list rather than adding to it, and an absolute path is
# used verbatim. Raising the version requires re-verifying that property before
# the digests are updated. See docs/guides/coderabbit-runbook.md, "Upgrading
# the pinned CLI".
CODERABBIT_CLI_VERSION=0.7.3
CODERABBIT_CLI_SHA256_LINUX_X64=c940c59a827e207905063cb66a8ce463928cd2d70b7bbd7d998cd79fc522800e
CODERABBIT_CLI_SHA256_LINUX_ARM64=7962ca2009cc96c9d24f412545ead9e95b9942bb669c31d1077fdbb2c52e5b24
CODERABBIT_CLI_SHA256_DARWIN_ARM64=4ffea6b2add7f779f09effa753fdedd0b6fbe7bbbb5a52dbb25abd7e9d62d1af
